---
title: Autonomy gate to live trading
---
flowchart TB
    PAPER["Paper trading evidence"] --> DAYS{"Clean paper days met"}
    DAYS -->|no| KEEP["Keep paper trading"]
    DAYS -->|yes| DD{"Drawdown inside bound"}
    DD -->|no| KEEP
    DD -->|yes| DRILL{"Halt drills passed"}
    DRILL -->|no| KEEP
    DRILL -->|yes| WON["Muse Wonder advisory read"]
    WON --> LIST["Operator signs go live checklist"]
    WON -. advisory only .-> LIST
    WON -. review note .-> WJ[("Journal")]
    LIST --> EN["Enable live adapter explicitly"]
    EN --> LIVE["Live ordering active"]
    LIVE --> KILL{"Kill switch or halt"}
    KILL -->|fired| OFF["Ordering halted needs reset"]
    KILL -->|clear| LIVE
    OFF --> LIST
